## SPKN Kernel
A fork from Parbinder7's kernel for Exynos 9611 Devices

### GOAL

Goal of this project is returning susfs to exynos 9611 kernel.
Few months ago, Susfs removed from 3 major 9611 kernel Because of KSUN hiding improvement, But that feature still can't hide some important props and Some apps can detect props of custom rom and caught you from using it.
## Installation

**☠️Before doing anything, If you have installed oneui or a one ui image from another phone on your phone, Installing this kernel could be result in soft bricking your phone. So please don't install it☠️**
Depending on your device model, download the device kernel from [Releases](https://github.com/istnein/SPKN-kernel-for-9611/releases) page.
Then go to twrp and flash it on your device.

Also If you need susfs, Download and Install it from [this page](https://github.com/sidex15/susfs4ksu-module/releases).
